    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9107" root="حمس" body-key="H">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَمِيسٌ</span></b>  <i>Vehement.</i> (TS, K.) So in the saying
of Ru-beh,
“<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَا قَيْنَ مِنْهُ حَمَسًا حَمِيسَا</span><br />
”
[<i>They experienced from it vehement strength</i>]:
(TS, TA:) or, as Az says, <i>strength and courage.</i>
(TA.) ― 
